<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Raumfreund __VERSION__</title>
<style>
  :root { --mint: #3dffa8; --sun: #ffd23f; --rose: #ff4d6d; --ink: #f4f1ff; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; color: var(--ink);
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 20%, #2b1055 0%, #120b2e 55%, #0b3d5c 100%);
    padding: 16px;
  }
  main {
    max-width: 560px; width: 100%; padding: 32px; border-radius: 28px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(61, 255, 168, 0.25), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 2.4rem; text-shadow: 0 0 18px var(--mint); }
  .lights span { display: inline-block; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 8px; }
  .g { background: var(--mint); box-shadow: 0 0 14px var(--mint); }
  .y { background: var(--sun); box-shadow: 0 0 14px var(--sun); }
  .r { background: var(--rose); box-shadow: 0 0 14px var(--rose); }
  a.button {
    display: block; margin: 24px 0 12px; padding: 18px; border-radius: 999px; text-align: center;
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem; color: #120b2e; text-decoration: none;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--mint), #7cf7ff); box-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(61, 255, 168, 0.6);
  }
  code { word-break: break-all; font-size: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.85; }
  small { opacity: 0.75; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <p class="lights" aria-hidden="true"><span class="g"></span><span class="y"></span><span class="r"></span></p>
  <h1>Raumfreund</h1>
  <p>Die freundliche Lautstärkeampel mit Katze Mia – Version <strong>__VERSION__</strong>.</p>
  <a class="button" href="__APK__" download>APK herunterladen</a>
  <p><small>SHA-256:</small><br><code>__SHA256__</code></p>
  <p><small>Installation: Datei auf dem Android-Gerät öffnen und „Installation aus dieser Quelle“ erlauben.
  Die App arbeitet offline, speichert kein Audio und sendet keine Daten.
  Quellcode: github.com/marcelpetrick/Raumfreund (GPL-3.0-only).</small></p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
